  "review_notes": [
    "The ASV reorders the object list to the end of the clause, so the waw opening וְגֶשֶׁם שׁוֹטֵף is aligned to the and at t014, which stands at that clause's English left edge; the alternative would leave that and added and this waw unrepresented, but rule 25 permits the discontinuity.",
